-- 3. Scene-Mesh Half-Space Control Barrier Function (virtual objects never penetrate physical desk/wall!):
--    Given current height above desk `h` (mm), downward displacement `drop`, and safety margin `h_min`:
vph-mesh-cbf-clamp : Word → Word → Word → Word
vph-mesh-cbf-clamp hMin h drop =
  if %wlt h (%wadd hMin drop) then hMin else %wsub h drop
